# Implementation

Cursor cloud agents implement code in this repo directly, including `ncaaf/`, `nfl/`, `docs/`, and skills.

Grok CLI remains an allowed option when it is installed and authenticated (`~/.grok/bin/grok`, `$GROK_BIN`, or `grok` on `PATH`). To use it, write the request to `results/grok-prompt.md` and run:

```bash
bash scripts/dispatch-grok.sh results/grok-prompt.md
```

If the CLI is missing or unauthenticated, implement the change in-session. Do not stop for `grok login`.

When using the dispatcher:

- Do not pass `-m` / `--model` or set `GROK_MODEL` (the dispatcher refuses both; reported ids are not launch ids).
- Do not use Claude/Codex CLIs for this repo.

Trivial answers that need no repo edits (e.g. “what’s the salary cap?”) may be answered from `ncaaf/docs/sites/fanduel-ncaaf.md` without either path.
